---
import MainLayout from '../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../../components/ContactCTA.astro';

const title = 'Kitchen Drain Cleaning & Garbage Disposal Service in Mason City, Iowa | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'Kitchen drain cleaning, garbage disposal jams, repair and installation, and dishwasher drain problems in Mason City and North Iowa. Call A-1 Drain Cleaning at 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/services/kitchen-drains/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container py-14 sm:py-18 lg:py-24">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <a href="/services/" class="hover:text-white">Services</a><span class="mx-2" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-white">Kitchen Drains</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">Kitchen drains • Garbage disposals • Dishwashers • Mason City • North Iowa</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Kitchen Drain Cleaning &amp; Garbage Disposal Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A slow kitchen sink can start with grease, food residue, or other material narrowing the drain. A-1 Drain Cleaning also handles garbage disposal jams, repair and installation, and kitchen dishwasher drain problems in Mason City and surrounding North Iowa communities.</p>
        <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white shadow-lg hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-start">
        <article>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Kitchen drains</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Slow kitchen sink? The blockage may be close to the fixture.</h2>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Kitchen drains commonly collect grease, food residue, and other material. A drain may get slower over time before it stops completely.</p>
          <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sink drains slowly</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sink will not drain</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water stands in the sink</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Sink backs up when another fixture is used</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Garbage disposal jams, repair and installation</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A garbage disposal that jams can leave the kitchen sink draining slowly or not at all. Food buildup, material caught in the disposal, or a problem farther down the kitchen drain can all affect how the sink drains.</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Garbage disposal is jammed</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Garbage disposal will not drain</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Garbage disposal needs repair</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Garbage disposal replacement or installation</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">If the disposal is jammed, do not put your hand into it. If the disposal needs repair or replacement, tell us what it is doing when you call so we can determine what service is needed.</p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Dishwasher drain problems</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A dishwasher and kitchen sink can share part of the same kitchen drainage path. A blockage can show up as water backing into the sink when the dishwasher drains, or as a dishwasher that does not drain properly.</p>
          <ul class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Dishwasher will not drain</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Water backs up into the kitchen sink</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Kitchen sink backs up when dishwasher runs</li>
            <li class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-700">Dishwasher drain line problem</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">One kitchen sink or several drains?</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">If only the kitchen sink is affected while the bathroom and other drains work normally, the restriction may be close to the kitchen fixture or its branch drain. If several fixtures back up together, the problem may be farther down a shared drain or main line.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-700">Do not pour grease down the sink. Let it cool and put it in the trash instead. When a kitchen drain is already backing up, avoid adding more water until the restriction is cleared.</p>

          <h2 class="mt-10 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Kitchen drain service in Mason City and North Iowa</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning serves Mason City and surrounding North Iowa communities. When you call, tell us whether the sink is slow or completely stopped, whether the garbage disposal is jammed, whether the dishwasher is backing water into the sink, and whether any other fixture changes when the kitchen sink is used.</p>
        </article>

        <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
            <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Kitchen drain problem?</p>
            <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950">Call A-1 Drain Cleaning</h2>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Slow sink, jammed disposal, or dishwasher drain problem? Call 641-530-2728.</p>
            <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="call-button mt-5 block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-6 py-4 text-center font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">Call 641-530-2728</a>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
    <ContactCTA />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
